[en.FOCUS_C12_MINE_TRAINING_CAMP]
Mine Training Camp

[en.FOCUS_C12_MINE_TRAINING_CAMP_desc]
We will continue to expand our advantage by militarizing our miners and providing military training. Ponies from other regions will also come to join under the guise of laborers. When these militia forces, never before seen in any intelligence reports, suddenly appear on the battlefield, it will catch the Empire off guard.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MINE_TRAINING_CAMP]
矿工训练营

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MINE_TRAINING_CAMP_desc]
我们将继续扩大我们的优势，对我们的矿工进行军事化训练，一些其他地区的小马也会以务工的名号进来参加，当这些从未出现在任何情报当中的民兵部队突然出现在战场上时，将让帝国猝不及防。

